              "spaceBefore": 0,
              "spaceAfter": 1,
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "indent": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Hence, express ",
                  "marks": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "math",
                  "latex": "\\frac{x^2+3x+1}{x+2}",
                  "display": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " in the form",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "p61-q53-b-requested-form",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "fontSize": null,
              "align": "center",
              "spaceBefore": 0,
              "spaceAfter": 1,
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "indent": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "type": "math",
                  "latex": "Ax+B+\\frac{C}{x+2}.",
                  "display": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x+1-\\dfrac{1}{x+2}$, where $x\\ne-2$.",
          "worked": "From (a),\n$$x^2+3x+1=(x+1)(x+2)-1.$$\nDivide by $x+2$, where $x\\ne-2$:\n$$\\frac{x^2+3x+1}{x+2}=x+1-\\frac{1}{x+2}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      }
